541 9.72386 16.541 10C16.541 10.2761 16.3171 10.5 16.041 10.5H3.95801C3.68203 10.4998 3.45804 10.276 3.45801 10C3.45801 9.72397 3.68202 9.50018 3.95801 9.5H16.041ZM16.041 5.125C16.3172 5.125 16.541 5.34886 16.541 5.625C16.541 5.90111 16.3171 6.125 16.041 6.125H3.95801C3.68204 6.12482 3.45804 5.901 3.45801 5.625C3.45801 5.34897 3.68202 5.12518 3.95801 5.125H16.041Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main id="main-content"><div data-page-top-spacer="condensed" class=""><section class="LandingPageSection-module-scss-module__ZSMdoa__root" data-theme="ivory"><div class="CSSGrid-module-scss-module__Bo9kyq__container" data-component="CSSGrid.Container"><h1 class="HeroStatement-module-scss-module__LOCOdG__text" style="visibility:hidden"><span class="HeroStatement-module-scss-module__LOCOdG__lead"><button type="button" data-lead-control="true" class="TeamLead-module-scss-module__v9lDbq__button">The Engineering team<span class="TeamLead-module-scss-module__v9lDbq__mark" aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark TeamLead-module-scss-module__v9lDbq__markImage" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/bad43304254e0bf9473cc61b0115b14ec10faac2-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span></span></button></span> <span class="HeroStatement-module-scss-module__LOCOdG__statement">builds the infrastructure that makes Claude reliable and trustworthy. They translate our research into production systems, and share what they learn about building, evaluating, and deploying AI agents at scale.</span></h1></div></section><section class="LandingPageSection-module-scss-module__ZSMdoa__root" data-theme="ivory"><div class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__inset-frame"><div class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__hero-carousel HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__unthemed HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__inset" style="visi