ass="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-slides"><div class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-body"><header class="AssetItem-module-scss-module__nUeDbq__header HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-meta"><div class="AssetItem-module-scss-module__nUeDbq__headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to  Redesigning source control at Anthropic" class="TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__tiny-more-button TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_7kll9anpfcnpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__icon" width="8" height="8"><use href="#tiny-more-button-close"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" class="TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__icon TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__icon-visible" width="12" height="2"><use href="#tiny-more-button-more"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class="TopicLink-module-scss-module__wN10Da__link" href="/engineering">Engineering</a></p><time class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-date">Oct 13, 2026</time></header><a class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-link" href="/research/redesigning-source-control"><h2 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-5 HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-title" data-component="Headline"> Redesigning source control at Anthropic</h2></a><p class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__body-4 HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-description" data-component="Body">As our merges per day grew more than tenfold, source control became our biggest development bottleneck. Here, we share how we migrated to an in-house version control system in five months.</p><a href="/research/redesigning-source-control" class="Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__button Button-module-scss-modul