"><h2 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-5 HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-title" data-component="Headline">Harness design for long-running application development</h2></a><p class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__body-4 HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-description" data-component="Body">Harness design is key to performance at the frontier of agentic coding. Here&#x27;s how we pushed Claude further in frontend design and long-running autonomous software engineering.</p><a href="/research/harness-design-long-running-apps" class="Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__button Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__corner-small Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__variant-secondary Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__size-small Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__icon-format-trailing HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-cta" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">Read more<span class="Button-module-scss-module__f9ZZrG__icon"><svg class="Icon-module-scss-module__lqbdHG__icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 21 21"><path d="M4.14585 9.87492L14.4584 9.87492L9.60419 5.04158L10.5 4.14575L16.8542 10.4999L10.5 16.8541L9.60419 15.9583L14.4584 11.1249L4.14585 11.1249L4.14585 9.87492Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-body" data-inactive="true" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><header class="AssetItem-module-scss-module__nUeDbq__header HeroCarousel-module-scss-module__5NNTzG__carousel-info-meta"><div class="AssetItem-module-scss-module__nUeDbq__headerButton"><button aria-label="Related to Designing AI-resistant technical evaluations" class="TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__tiny-more-button TinyMoreButton-module-scss-module__hN4zBq__state-closed" type="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_7ktl9anpfcnpfkq6btb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" c