-block"><span class="textAlignment-module-scss-module__i2IE5q__align--center">Explore work from other teams</span></span></h2></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__carousel-wrapper"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__embla-viewport"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/bae724ca9a2d841126a8b9dd6206d4ad831dca90-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/research/team/alignment"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Alignment</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">47<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Works to understand the risks of AI models and develop ways to ensure future ones remain helpful, honest, and harmless.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/4682543d5daed87cf7537e0a19ba25a7e010c008-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/research/team/economics"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Economics</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">25<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Studies and monitors the impact of AI systems on individuals, firms, and economies.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/78cdaab99157387a65ebe000372343cf3554a8fb-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/research/team/frontier-red-team"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Frontier Red Team</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">34<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Stress-tests AI systems to understand the full extent of their current capabilities and anticipate what comes next.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/852c63559ab7fa9efe59fd17f955664800fff92a-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/research/team/interpretability"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Interpretability</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">35<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Studies how large language models work internally as a foundation for AI safety.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/23cca33c21eddb8f7ec75d5bf606c1f5a2146e00-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/research/team/societal-impacts"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Societal Impacts</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">24<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Studies how AI affects people, both individually and collectively.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stagger-item" style="visibility:hidden"><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-header"><span aria-hidden="true" class="SpriteMark-module-scss-module__6xvBMG__mark FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-image" style="mask-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/888b2270623ed548bb2b6514024d49757127cf47-1152x1088.webp);mask-size:1800% 1700%;mask-position:0% 0%"></span><div><a href="/science"><h3 class="typography-module-scss-module__tOQyXa__headline-6 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__item-title" data-component="Headline">Science</h3></a><p class="text-caption-1 FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__PostsCount">18<!-- --> posts</p></div></div><div><p class="body-2 serif">Explores how AI can increase the pace of scientific progress through both research and collaborations.</p></div></div><div class="FeaturedTeams-module-scss-module__kMamaW__list-item js-stag