ame our biggest development bottleneck. Here, we share how we migrated to an in-house version control system in five months.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"redesigning-source-control\"},\"summary\":\"As our merges per day grew more than tenfold, source control became our biggest development bottleneck. Here, we share how we migrated to an in-house version control system in five months.\",\"title\":\" Redesigning source control at Anthropic\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Coding\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"economy-and-society\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-7f6eedf4-2585-4902-9502-a0088a99e984\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:24Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":866,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/5ebc85c6325c7f59bd6c08950ff9beb1863f1345-1920x866.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/5fae1ecca4cd8aaefb9ac949348e96967f9a5100-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/ffc97a876bdeba2031ddaeef79a954e9b1b2d52a-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/a81ed723d52f6fb2e7bc5ca51471496b1307101a-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/beb481a2e7b314f73ba37821a2c1f1ca470d7063-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/118ff3828869f4aafb6a37e5a415a0b7182d7179-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/0cc828e34b960887baa1a326d06feb5e677b6dd7-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-05-25\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"As agents grow more capable, so does their potential blast radius. Here's what we learned building containment for claude.ai, Claude Code, and Cowork.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"how-we-contain-claude\"},\"summary\":\"As agents grow more capable, so does their potential blast radius. The engineering question is how to cap it. Here’s what we’ve learned building containment for claude.ai, Claude Code, and Cowork.\\n\",\"title\":\"How we contain Claude across products\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Safeguards\",\"topic\":\"safety\"},\"topics\":[\"safety\",\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-d99b3e41-18b4-45ac-b09c-fc7796568d86\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:26Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":2160,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/de3bcf9733b61f57234d8c45e663b1bd48677ea1-3840x2160.png\",\"width\":3840},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2260,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/459b2a8a0baa88937eebcbe4566dde4d6cc7f185-3794x2260.png\",\"width\":3794},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1198,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/332d9c487bb73c8078686068dcbe1b616720a8dd-3016x1198.png\",\"width\":3016}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/eee2321d5fd36370a806f20e3da7a580ed80d54c-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/ab863ec09d7cd36cc90eebbbf3b124afdf552d28-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-04-23\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"We traced recent reports of Claude Code quality issues to three separate changes. Here's what happened, what we fixed, and what we're changing.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"april-23-postmortem\"},\"summary\":\"We traced recent reports of Claude Code quality issues to three separate changes. Here's what happened and what we're changing.\",\"title\":\"An update on recent Claude Code quality reports\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Claude Code\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"understanding-ai\",\"safety\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-fd0a9c33-8c7b-493e-ba72-af53b29b576d\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:31Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/903b624ada206b10753a24c6a1367e74a869165d-1080x1080.png\",\"width\":1080},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1596,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/73e900af5b9d6ed8c64db0a8e74d4465963556b7-1640x1596.png\",\"width\":1640},{\"description\":null,\"height\":200,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/cf0719d7832b1f577b7393c84a7c53eecc725ca4-760x200.png\",\"width\":760},{\"description\":null,\"height\":243,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/4f67b1c10566552aec514a716ea43544ab330e0b-668x243.png\",\"width\":668}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/3e5ad326fc2d0cd1336e92d1fd7ce138a2ecb991-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/bbac4e5947fd3722aab1e3b5c3964cb92eed38d5-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-04-08\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Harnesses encode assumptions that go stale as models improve. See how Managed Agents is built around interfaces that stay stable as harnesses change.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"managed-agents\"},\"summary\":\"Harnesses encode assumptions that go stale as models improve. Managed Agents—our hosted service for long-horizon agent work—is built around interfaces that stay stable as harnesses change.\",\"title\":\"Scaling Managed Agents: Decoupling the brain from the hands\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agents\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\",\"safety\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-0ec4d93d-4448-4c63-a754-c98f04b900da\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:28Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":1920,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/d6b34bdb92808fd5739e4d14340a1752d5607dda-1920x1920.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2002,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/05f268391243c60c3f725c26151eed7b0b531e86-1920x2002.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1679,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/411b97a06450b27b11f1f9a952ab03d37d8ca3a3-1920x1679.png\",\"width\":1920},{\"description\":null,\"height\":1935,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/58a83df591dc5a2344a65216d4f8eaee3c074fa1-1920x1935.png\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/216b143c9775e5a24fb2f0bb9771306a4fbb7e16-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/2c98383d908cd4d2385339590565036e6acad3a2-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-03-25\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Claude Code users approve 93% of permission prompts. See how auto mode uses classifiers to cut approval fatigue while keeping developers safe.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"claude-code-auto-mode\"},\"summary\":\"Claude Code users approve 93% of permission prompts. We built classifiers to automate some decisions, increasing safety while reducing approval fatigue. Here's what it catches, and what it misses.\\n\",\"title\":\"How we built Claude Code auto mode: a safer way to skip permissions\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Claude Code\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"safety\",\"understanding-ai\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-d247b270-f917-40ca-8d67-d5ae517e117d\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T19:57:16Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/7994a876c61234be5615ab63f58751a155c5f0fb-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/34280d14d7a4dfc7c5a240929034f101515ed20a-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-03-24\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":null,\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"harness-design-long-running-apps\"},\"summary\":\"Harness design is key to performance at the frontier of agentic coding. Here's how we pushed Claude further in frontend design and long-running autonomous software engineering.\",\"title\":\"Harness design for long-running application development\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agents\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-64994483-855a-4fbe-8005-86a2e6b00a10\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:35Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/53bbc92083cde1db33b8f51862d5640c4b8c9394-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/de4b6c1bf12fd6e9ff83fdc22cbba01aa02e87d8-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/5d455b6a663cc1ecbc5e9a58144e2ccffbdecfc5-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-03-06\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Evaluating Claude Opus 4.6 on BrowseComp, we found cases where the model recognized the test and decrypted its answers, raising eval integrity questions.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"eval-awareness-browsecomp\"},\"summary\":\"Evaluating Opus 4.6 on BrowseComp, we found cases where the model recognized the test, then found and decrypted answers to it—raising questions about eval integrity in web-enabled environments.\",\"title\":\"Eval awareness in Claude Opus 4.6’s BrowseComp performance\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Benchmarks\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\",\"safety\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-7866c993-b121-4d80-8db9-f1299a687c3a\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:18Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/69bde0b46f86787e366c1ef24e013f59fa632a01-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/194765a666e35f8c949cb75edce4e104ff98fda5-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-02-05\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"How a team of 16 parallel Claude agents wrote a Rust-based C compiler from scratch, capable of compiling the Linux kernel, and what it taught us.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"building-c-compiler\"},\"summary\":\"Nicholas Carlini, a researcher on our Safeguards team, explains how he tasked 16 agents with writing a Rust-based C compiler, from scratch, capable of compiling the Linux kernel. \",\"title\":\"Building a C compiler with a team of parallel Claudes\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agents\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-15c5f0b4-11a3-4226-91a9-2d29fe681924\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:37Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/36ce2ba5ce208fb8531d1a840a9cd35ff4959a02-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/8f28cfb71da07d72e0dad38b6e2005691f5f5775-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/5c2f09684f474088555eae43c00d828e6a6e2183-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-02-05\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Agentic coding benchmarks are treated as precise measures of model capability, but infrastructure configuration alone can meaningfully shift scores.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"infrastructure-noise\"},\"summary\":\"Agentic coding benchmarks are often treated as precise measurements of relative model capability. However, we’ve found that infrastructure configuration alone can produce meaningful differences in the scores.\",\"title\":\"Quantifying infrastructure noise in agentic coding evals\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Benchmarks\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"economy-and-society\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-e1ff5bb9-f493-4907-b4d1-2599e096f074\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T19:58:11Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":831,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/ebebb22ddbba7103f3af4e8a55a13245d3897802-2149x831.png\",\"width\":2149},{\"description\":null,\"height\":463,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/378256f8023fc3d48f2992b9ee9884a4658e3ab1-1681x463.png\",\"width\":1681}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/bc67c5af6898dda178ea8c99c23daf6945913ea3-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/e53e6b703eca6d16db69a95389896b8a3c0ffd43-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-01-21\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"What we learned from three iterations of a performance engineering take-home that Claude keeps beating.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"AI-resistant-technical-evaluations\"},\"summary\":\"What we learned from three iterations of a performance engineering take-home that Claude keeps beating.\",\"title\":\"Designing AI-resistant technical evaluations\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Coding\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"economy-and-society\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-31c2076f-7327-4762-b55c-8d0644b7b94f\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:21Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":null,\"height\":2834,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/bd42e7b2f3e9bb5218142796d3ede4816588dec0-4584x2834.png\",\"width\":4584},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2580,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/0205b36f9639fc27f2f6566f73cb56b06f59d555-4584x2580.png\",\"width\":4584},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2580,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/3ddac5be07a0773922ec9df06afec55922f8194a-4584x2580.png\",\"width\":4584},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2580,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/0db40cc0e14402222a179fc6297b9c8818e97c8a-4584x2580.png\",\"width\":4584},{\"description\":null,\"height\":2580,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/b77b8dbb7c2e57f063fbc8a087a853d5809b74b0-4584x2580.png\",\"width\":4584}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/2a8e8981aa4b76218bc6d8be26c8c8509a3943e4-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/36f579d5e654ff32368069dd1f51c0e8a8f3ad7a-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2026-01-09\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Guidance on designing more rigorous, useful evals for AI agents across a range of architectures and real-world deployment use cases.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents\"},\"summary\":\"Guidance on how to design more rigorous and useful evals for agents across a range of agent architectures and use cases in real-world deployment.\",\"title\":\"Demystifying evals for AI agents\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agents\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"economy-and-society\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-53177101-07d5-4bb1-b00e-30940f786f72\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:39Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\" Screenshots taken by Claude through the Puppeteer MCP server as it tested the claude.ai clone. \",\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/f94c2257964fb2d623f1e81f874977ebfc0986bc-1920x1080.gif\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/206b89968296c447846d1434e5826eced5cb9bdd-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/3ac9c563c6df0ef5b9ba84d264b32bacb6f0802c-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-11-26\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"How an initializer agent and an incremental coding agent help the Claude Agent SDK make steady progress across many context windows.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents\"},\"summary\":\"We developed a two-fold solution to enable the Claude Agent SDK to work effectively across many context windows: an initializer agent that sets up the environment on the first run, and a coding agent that is tasked with making incremental progress in every session while leaving clear artifacts for the next session. \",\"title\":\"Effective harnesses for long-running agents\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agents\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-bbeaa953-2874-47ff-80d8-b35b7ac3be26\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:47Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"Tool Search Tool diagram\",\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/f359296f770706608901eadaffbff4ca0b67874c-1999x1125.png\",\"width\":1999},{\"description\":\"Programmatic tool calling flow\",\"height\":1491,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/65737d69a3290ed5c1f3c3b8dc873645a9dcc2eb-1999x1491.png\",\"width\":1999}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/863c352069c90ea10af076f5e00af52a6101ca07-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/dbce48f3e5326313a0ca293041ec47a2af9ff0c2-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-11-24\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Claude can now discover, learn, and execute tools dynamically to enable agents that take action in the real world. Here’s how.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"advanced-tool-use\"},\"summary\":\"We’ve added three new beta features that let Claude discover, learn, and execute tools dynamically. Here’s how they work.\",\"title\":\"Introducing advanced tool use on the Claude Developer Platform\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Tool use\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"understanding-ai\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-15da8878-5f83-4cc7-85cb-c1a3c5cea708\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:15Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"Image of how the MCP client works with the MCP server and LLM.\",\"height\":1080,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/9ecf165020005c09a22a9472cee6309555485619-1920x1080.png\",\"width\":1920}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/7c04b1a7c9df91c3c01f6e77abb99caca5eb95ba-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/3e0d0372816b05a6b7a5d21f364412dede1c3497-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-11-04\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Learn how code execution with the Model Context Protocol enables agents to handle more tools while using fewer tokens, reducing context overhead by up to 98.7%.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"code-execution-with-mcp\"},\"summary\":null,\"title\":\"Code execution with MCP: Building more efficient agents\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Model Context Protocol\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"understanding-ai\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-9e735c0b-2f2b-4b33-8bc9-c95d82e601a8\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:55Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"This image illustrations how sandboxing in Claude Code works.\",\"height\":2305,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/0d1c612947c798aef48e6ab4beb7e8544da9d41a-4096x2305.png\",\"width\":4096},{\"description\":\"This illustration depicts how Claude Code on the web uses a custom proxy to handle all git interactions.\",\"height\":2305,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/e8f66bcf73d9d23cae67e67776b2d31373c13050-4096x2305.png\",\"width\":4096}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/e227a9f2aa1d77a89d12db9659ed1a9e5e0a316f-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/b95241b80efe872ba6f1c42ded721fffc3347154-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-10-20\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Learn how sandboxing in Claude Code uses filesystem and network isolation to protect developers, reduce permission prompts, and increase autonomy.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"claude-code-sandboxing\"},\"summary\":null,\"title\":\"Beyond permission prompts: making Claude Code more secure and autonomous\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Claude Code\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"understanding-ai\",\"safety\",\"anthropic\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-62977278-f148-4f1f-912e-dbcd4dee6183\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:26:58Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"To activate skills, all you need to do is write a SKILL.md file with custom guidance for your agent.\",\"height\":929,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/ddd7e6e572ad0b6a943cacefe957248455f6d522-1650x929.jpg\",\"width\":1650},{\"description\":\"Anatomy of a SKILL.md file including the relevant metadata: name, description, and context related to the specific actions the skill should take.\",\"height\":929,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/6f22d8913dbc6228e7f11a41e0b3c124d817b6d2-1650x929.jpg\",\"width\":1650},{\"description\":\"How to bundle additional content into a SKILL.md file.\",\"height\":1069,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/191bf5dd4b6f8cfe6f1ebafe6243dd1641ed231c-1650x1069.jpg\",\"width\":1650},{\"description\":\"This image depicts how progressive disclosure of context in Skills.\",\"height\":673,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/a3bca2763d7892982a59c28aa4df7993aaae55ae-2292x673.jpg\",\"width\":2292},{\"description\":\"This image depicts how skills are triggered in your context window.\",\"height\":929,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/441b9f6cc0d2337913c1f41b05357f16f51f702e-1650x929.jpg\",\"width\":1650}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/044b577cc75c26c3f13a1c5e023d8749f00bb24e-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/56a9b2a8ba7bf8f902d24d22f90e6ddf83b91fb5-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-10-16\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"Introducing Agent Skills: organized folders of instructions, scripts, and resources that give Claude the procedural knowledge real work requires.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"equipping-agents-for-the-real-world-with-agent-skills\"},\"summary\":\"Claude is powerful, but real work requires procedural knowledge and organizational context. Introducing Agent Skills, a new way to build specialized agents using files and folders.\",\"title\":\"Equipping agents for the real world with Agent Skills\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Agent Skills\",\"topic\":\"claude\"},\"topics\":[\"claude\",\"understanding-ai\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-de6d63b0-1525-4a0c-9f26-14f4e355eb86\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:28:08Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"Prompt engineering vs. context engineering\",\"height\":1290,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/faa261102e46c7f090a2402a49000ffae18c5dd6-2292x1290.png\",\"width\":2292},{\"description\":\"Calibrating the system prompt in the process of context engineering.\",\"height\":1288,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/0442fe138158e84ffce92bed1624dd09f37ac46f-2292x1288.png\",\"width\":2292}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/13934db1b35d8f67b654d08339874d895fd21e66-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/eea56827155af53c9044289d1681fbf69e2c4c33-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-09-29\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"In this post, we explore strategies for effectively curating and managing their context.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents\"},\"summary\":\"We explore the emerging art of context engineering and offer a refined mental model for building steerable, effective agents.\",\"title\":\"Effective context engineering for AI agents\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Context engineering\",\"topic\":\"understanding-ai\"},\"topics\":[\"understanding-ai\",\"claude\"]},{\"_id\":\"article-37c75b1c-06ad-4007-9697-9ac98786883c\",\"_type\":\"article\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:27:52Z\",\"articleType\":\"research\",\"bodyImages\":[{\"description\":\"Illustrative timeline of events on the Claude API. Yellow: issue detected, Red: degradation worsened, Green: fix deployed.\",\"height\":1800,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/d707dfc2effceba608d04007bc776132a3e57838-3840x1800.png\",\"width\":3840},{\"description\":\"Code snippet of a December 2024 patch to work around the unexpected dropped token bug when temperature = 0.\",\"height\":500,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/efee0d3d25f6b03cbfc57e70e0e364dcd8b82fe0-2000x500.png\",\"width\":2000},{\"description\":\"Code snippet showing minimized reproducer merged as part of the August 11 change that root-caused the “bug” being worked around in December 2024; in reality, it’s expected behavior of the xla_allow_excess_precision flag.\",\"height\":2560,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/6d10e58c0bd5fd7cb03dc0adc716cb1e4f039343-2000x2560.png\",\"width\":2000},{\"description\":\"Slack message showing reproducer of the underlying approximate top-k bug shared with the XLA:TPU engineers who developed the algorithm. The code returns correct results when run on CPUs.\",\"height\":1404,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/7e42db934d0e84ea40fc56b416ddb09b2097a5ff-2400x1404.png\",\"width\":2400}],\"cardImage\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1280,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/5c2bc1570b8149182ee170bddbdb32713fc666db-1280x1280.jpg\",\"width\":1280},\"cardTeams\":[{\"slug\":\"engineering\",\"title\":\"Engineering\"}],\"hero\":{\"description\":null,\"height\":1125,\"hotspot\":null,\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/4zrzovbb/website/55f6ae5b6156f26c14695939ff77d4f4bc4e82f8-2000x1125.jpg\",\"width\":2000},\"linkedUrl\":null,\"newsCategories\":null,\"publishedOn\":\"2025-09-17\",\"sensitive\":null,\"seoDescription\":\"A technical report on three bugs that intermittently degraded Claude's responses: what happened, why fixes took time, and what we're changing.\",\"slug\":{\"_type\":\"slug\",\"current\":\"a-postmortem-of-three-recent-issues\"},\"summary\":\"A technical report on three bugs that intermittently degraded responses from Claude. Below we explain what happened, why it took time to fix, and what we're changing.\",\"title\":\"A postmortem of three recent issues\",\"topicTag\":{\"name\":\"Transparency\",\"topic\":\"safety\"},\"topi